{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <div class=\"no-overflow\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><\/p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>&nbsp;<div class=\"mediaplugin mediaplugin_videojs d-block\"><div style=\"max-width:640px;\"><\/div><\/div>&nbsp;<br><\/strong><\/p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>1.&nbsp;\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3059\u30fb\u3055\u3057\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><span>\r\n    <div align=\"center\">\r\n        <table border=\"1\">\r\n            <colgroup>\r\n                <col width=\"464\">\r\n            <\/colgroup>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                        <p dir=\"ltr\">\u6bce\u5e74\u3001\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30de\u30b9\u306b\u306f\u3001\u5b50\u3069\u3082\u306b\u3044\u308d\u3044\u308d\u306a\u3082\u306e\u3092\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002<\/p>\r\n                        <p dir=\"ltr\">(H\u00e0ng n\u0103m, c\u1ee9 v\u00e0o gi\u00e1ng sinh t\u00f4i l\u1ea1i t\u1eb7ng b\u1ecdn tr\u1ebb r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ed3.)<\/p>\r\n                        <p dir=\"ltr\">\u30ea\u3055\u3093\u306f\u305b\u3093\u3071\u3044\u306b\u3001\u304b\u3070\u3093\u3092\u3055\u3057\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002<\/p>\r\n                        <p dir=\"ltr\">(Li \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eb7ng ti\u1ec1n b\u1ed1i c\u00e1i c\u1eb7p.)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table><br>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div dir=\"ltr\"><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/div>\r\n    <p dir=\"ltr\">D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t ngh\u0129a: Ai \u0111\u00f3 t\u1eb7ng g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3.<\/p>\r\n    <p dir=\"ltr\">Khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn l\u00e0 c\u1ea5p tr\u00ean, ti\u1ec1n b\u1ed1i, ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed tr\u00ean m\u00ecnh s\u1ebd d\u00f9ng: \u3055\u3057\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3059&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n    <p dir=\"ltr\">(Kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c t\u1eb7ng cho m\u00ecnh.)&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n    <p dir=\"ltr\">C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><br>\r\n    <div align=\"center\">\r\n        <table border=\"1\">\r\n            <colgroup>\r\n                <col width=\"527\">\r\n            <\/colgroup>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                        <p dir=\"ltr\">\u3000N1\uff08\u4eba\uff09\u306f\u3000N2\uff08\u4eba\uff09\u306b\u3000N3\uff08\u3082\u306e\uff09\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3059\u30fb\u3055\u3057\u3042\u3052\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p>\r\n                    <\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table><br>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div dir=\"ltr\"><strong>\r\n            <p dir=\"ltr\">Unit 17\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0820\u500b\uff09<\/p>\r\n           <div align=\"center\">\r\n                <table border=\"1\">\r\n                    <colgroup>\r\n                        <col width=\"234\">\r\n                        <col width=\"145\">\r\n                        <col width=\"236\">\r\n                    <\/colgroup>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>\r\n                                <p dir=\"ltr\">\u3053\u3068\u3070<\/p>\r\n                            <\/td>\r\n                            <td>\r\n                                <p dir=\"ltr\">\u6f22\u5b57<\/p>\r\n                            <\/td>\r\n                            <td>\r\n                                <p dir=\"ltr\">\u30d9\u30c8\u30ca\u30e0\u8a9e<\/p>\r\n                            <\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>\r\n                                <p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <\/td>\r\n                            <td><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br><\/span><\/td>\r\n                     